    'hint.PC_MONITOR': 'Monitor: the screen turns on when a complete, powered computer is detected nearby.',
    'hint.PC_CASE': 'Computer case: an open multi-cell chassis. Place the motherboard and components inside or near it; a case is required for a complete desktop build.',
    'hint.TURBO': 'Turbocharger: its turbine spins with nearby rotating machinery and boosts local pressure, warming the compressed intake.',
    'hint.AIR_FILTER': 'Air filter: a multi-cell filter housing that traps nearby smoke particles into ash in this simplified model.',
